## 🔗 Visualization

To generate a visual representation of this closure hierarchy, use the following command:

```bash
# Generate GraphViz DOT file and convert to PNG
azdw visualize graph --from-closure {{ closure_file }} --format graphviz --output {{ closure_file | string.replace '.json' '' }}.dot

# Convert to PNG using GraphViz (requires GraphViz to be installed)
dot -Tpng {{ closure_file | string.replace '.json' '' }}.dot -o {{ closure_file | string.replace '.json' '' }}.png
```

After generating the PNG, you can add it to this document:

```markdown
![Work Item Hierarchy]({{ closure_file | string.replace '.json' '' }}.png)
```

